#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""jxb - Jetson Orin cross-dev CLI (host side).

Builds the xbuild image and the sysroot of a profile, runs a long-lived dev container with workspaces mounted
at their host paths (so compile_commands.json, debug info and clangd work on host and in the container alike),
cross-builds ROS 2 workspaces and talks to boards over SSH (keys only).

  jxb image build | runtime           build the xbuild image / the board runtime image (--mode container)
  jxb sysroot build [--add PKG ...]   build the profile's sysroot from the board's apt repos (no emulation)
  jxb up [-w DIR ...] | down          create/remove the dev container (workspaces mounted read-write)
  jxb shell | exec -- CMD ...         shell / command in the container (current directory kept if mounted)
  jxb build [colcon args]             cross-colcon-build in the current workspace
  jxb test [--board NAME]             cross-build the jxb test suite, check it, optionally run it on a board
  jxb board list | check NAME         inventory; compare a board's packages with the sysroot
  jxb deploy NAME [--ws DIR]          rsync install-<profile>/ to the board
  jxb run NAME -- CMD ...             run CMD on the board with ROS and the deployed install sourced
  jxb launch NAME [--monitor] [--bag] [--with CMD] [--duration S] -- PKG FILE | LAUNCH_FILE [ARGS]
                                      deploy + ros2 launch on the board, optionally recorded (traces/<board>/...)
  jxb ssh NAME                        interactive shell on the board, same environment as run
  jxb gui NAME -- PROGRAM [ARGS ...]  a board program as a window here (X11 over SSH), e.g. rqt, nsys-ui
  jxb debug NAME --pkg P --exe E      gdbserver on the board (SSH-tunnelled) + cross gdb with sysroot and local
        [--launch PKG FILE] [--cuda]  symbols; --launch starts E through a launch file (launch-prefix filter);
                                      --cuda: cuda-gdbserver + cuda-gdb, for CUDA kernels too
  jxb gdb [--cuda] [-- GDB ARGS]      cross gdb (or cuda-gdb) for the profile (VS Code: toolchain/bin/jxb-gdb)
  jxb trace nsys|tegrastats|kernel NAME [options] [-- CMD ...]
                                      Nsight Systems / tegrastats / ftrace on the board -> traces/<board>/...
  jxb trace report [DIR|BOARD|latest] | list   analysis of a recording (summary.json) / recordings
  jxb vscode init [-w DIR]            VS Code tasks + debug configurations (build, deploy, run, debug, trace)

Global options: --profile NAME (default from jxb.toml or the only profile), --dry-run,
  --mode auto|native|container (board commands natively or in the profile's runtime container; auto: container
  only when the profile's Ubuntu release differs from the board's).
Local config (gitignored): jxb.toml (defaults), boards.toml (inventory, see boards.example.toml).
"""
